WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.901
-Welcome back to the show,
everybody.

00:00:03.901 --> 00:00:07.400
You know, not a lot of things
are certain in this crazy world.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.300
We scurry through life
lickety-split

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.200
from one fleeting experience
to another.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.200
Nothing seems sacred anymore.
Nothing seems permanent.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.133
And that's why this week at
"The Tonight Show,"

00:00:17.133 --> 00:00:19.601
we're saluting the one thing we
know is still permanent --

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:22.534
the permanent,
a.k.a. the permanent wave,

00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:24.300
a.k.a. the perm.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.367
That's right --
it's time for the return of

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:28.167
"Tonight Show Perm Week."

00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:29.300
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.901
-♪ It's Perm Week ♪

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:35.868
♪ On the "Fallon" show ♪

00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:39.434
♪ It's Perm Week ♪

00:00:39.434 --> 00:00:45.667
♪ Oh, my God ♪

00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:46.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:46.968 --> 00:00:48.968
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:58.868
-This is
"Tonight Show Perm Week,"

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:00.667
the very special week where,
every day,

00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:02.200
we pick someone
from our audience

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.300
and stylishly perm their hair.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:08.467
Tonight's lucky perm recipient
is Alyssa Mancuso.

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:10.000
Alyssa is 25 years old.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.601
She's from the Poconos,

00:01:11.601 --> 00:01:13.467
and she's very excited about
her new hairdo.

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:16.200
It's been a big day for Alyssa.
Take a look.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:19.567
-Hi. My name is Alyssa Mancuso,
and today, I'm getting a perm.

00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:21.968
I don't know if I have the
bone structure for a perm.

00:01:21.968 --> 00:01:23.200
I guess we'll find out.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.601
-We're Alyssa's friends.

00:01:24.601 --> 00:01:26.234
-And we're excited to see
her perm.

00:01:26.234 --> 00:01:28.534
-So, I really don't think
Alyssa's done, like,

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:30.033
anything crazy with her hair.

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:32.667
-I have never done anything
crazy with my hair.

00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:34.000
This will be the craziest thing
I've ever done.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:36.234
This is how it's been.
I was born with the bangs.

00:01:36.234 --> 00:01:39.167
-I'm very curious to see how
the bangs look.

00:01:39.167 --> 00:01:41.234
-Like, I've only seen perms
in the movies,

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.167
and I didn't know
that people still got perms.

00:01:43.167 --> 00:01:45.601
-I want to feel like
my hair bounces when I walk.

00:01:45.601 --> 00:01:47.067
I feel like that would be fun.

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:49.934
-Someone we hope she won't look
like is Little Orphan Annie.

00:01:49.934 --> 00:01:51.734
It's very tight
and very high up.

00:01:51.734 --> 00:01:53.234
I think that's the worst way
this could go.

00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:56.400
-All my life, I was known as
the girl with the bangs,

00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:00.133
and now, good or bad, I will be
known as the girl with the perm.

00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:03.067
Maybe I'll look really great and
I'll be a perm girl from now on.

00:02:03.067 --> 00:02:04.434
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:05.567
Maybe you will
look really great.

00:02:05.567 --> 00:02:06.868
I think you will.

00:02:06.868 --> 00:02:10.601
Now, Alyssa has been sequestered
since she got permed,

00:02:10.601 --> 00:02:13.701
so she hasn't seen herself yet.

00:02:13.701 --> 00:02:15.434
And her friends
haven't seen her either.

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:18.601
This entire process
has been cloaked in secrecy.

00:02:18.601 --> 00:02:19.667
We've got her friends
right here.

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:21.000
Say hello, guys. How are you?

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.667
-Good.
-Good.

00:02:22.667 --> 00:02:24.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:24.434 --> 00:02:26.434
-I like when we interviewed
you before,

00:02:26.434 --> 00:02:30.934
you said, "We're Alyssa's
friends" at the same time.

00:02:30.934 --> 00:02:33.133
Are you excited to see
what she looks like?

00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:34.567
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:02:34.567 --> 00:02:38.033
-Wow. You really are
like a band almost.

00:02:38.033 --> 00:02:39.701
Alright, now,
don't remove the blindfolds

00:02:39.701 --> 00:02:41.200
until I tell you, please.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.501
Audience, are you ready for the

00:02:42.501 --> 00:02:44.367
brand-new,
freshly permed Alyssa?

00:02:44.367 --> 00:02:45.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:45.834 --> 00:02:49.200
Here is Alyssa before.
[ Drumroll ]

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:52.033
And here she is now.
Alyssa, come on out!

00:02:52.033 --> 00:02:53.467
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:02:53.467 --> 00:02:55.567
-♪ Oh, my God ♪

00:02:55.567 --> 00:03:01.033
-Wow. Whoa! Wow.

00:03:01.033 --> 00:03:03.601
Wow! They gave you some frizz.

00:03:03.601 --> 00:03:05.033
They gave you some -- Wow!

00:03:05.033 --> 00:03:08.200
They gave her some extra frizzle
in the front there.

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.667
They really -- It's cute.
It's really cute.

00:03:10.667 --> 00:03:11.767
You look great.

00:03:11.767 --> 00:03:13.234
-I love a little extra frizzle,
you know?

00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:15.300
-Yeah, you look cute. Yeah.
Alright, guys, it's time.

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:16.434
Are you ready to see Alyssa?

00:03:16.434 --> 00:03:17.534
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:03:17.534 --> 00:03:18.667
-Oh, wow.

00:03:18.667 --> 00:03:22.234
Alright, hold hands
and follow me over here.

00:03:22.234 --> 00:03:23.934
Okay, here we come.

00:03:23.934 --> 00:03:25.634
Alright.

00:03:25.634 --> 00:03:28.400
On the count of three,
take off your blindfolds.

00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.334
One, two, three.
[ Drumroll ]

00:03:30.334 --> 00:03:31.767
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:03:31.767 --> 00:03:38.067
-♪ Oh, my God ♪

00:03:38.067 --> 00:03:40.434
-That's not a great --
-The look of horror!

00:03:40.434 --> 00:03:42.367
-The look of horror.

00:03:42.367 --> 00:03:44.601
-You guys have
never been less supportive.

00:03:44.601 --> 00:03:46.968
-Yes, that was
terrible reaction.

00:03:46.968 --> 00:03:49.133
You should have been like,
"Yeah, wow!"

00:03:49.133 --> 00:03:50.868
-Oh, my gosh! Whoa!

00:03:50.868 --> 00:03:52.400
-No, you can't redo
the reaction.

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:55.067
It's real.

00:03:55.067 --> 00:03:57.167
I think you look gorgeous.
-Thank you. There's one.

00:03:57.167 --> 00:04:00.133
-Now, for the most important
reveal of all, Alyssa,

00:04:00.133 --> 00:04:01.534
are you ready to see yourself?

00:04:01.534 --> 00:04:02.734
-No, not at all.
[ Drumroll ]

00:04:02.734 --> 00:04:04.267
-You have to.
-Not at all.

00:04:04.267 --> 00:04:06.434
-Three, two, one, reveal.

00:04:08.334 --> 00:04:11.434
-♪ Oh, my God ♪

00:04:11.434 --> 00:04:15.534
-What are you talking about?

00:04:15.534 --> 00:04:17.434
-Oh, my God.

00:04:17.434 --> 00:04:19.501
-What are you talking about?

00:04:19.501 --> 00:04:21.200
-This is not
what I thought it would be.

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:22.234
-Yes, it is!

00:04:22.234 --> 00:04:24.868
This is exactly --
You look great.

00:04:24.868 --> 00:04:28.100
How long are you gonna keep it?
-I don't know.

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:31.100
Our thanks to the
Randy Darden hair salon

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.701
for this wonderful perm.

00:04:32.701 --> 00:04:34.067
Happy Perm Week, everyone.
-Oh, my God.

00:04:34.067 --> 00:04:36.100
-We'll be right back with
Super Bowl champion

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:38.234
Travis Kelce.

00:04:38.234 --> 00:04:40.667
-♪ It's Perm Week ♪

00:04:42.167 --> 00:04:45.467
♪ On the "Fallon" show ♪

00:04:45.467 --> 00:04:49.300
